SQL示例(同日推进): UPDATE global_state SET prev_scene_time = '2026-02-03 09:00', elapsed_time = '3 小时 ', cur_time = '2026-02-03 12:00' WHERE row_id = 1;

SQL示例(跨日推进): UPDATE global_state SET prev_scene_time = '2026-02-03 23:55', elapsed_time = '20 分 ', cur_time = '2026-02-04 00:15' WHERE row_id = 1;

